  "headline": "King Hrolf Kraki guide (God of War Ragnarok): a stability-first strategy to beat the Berserker King",
  "description": "King Hrolf is a composite fight. The consistent win condition is short, guaranteed punishes and removing your main failure mode with stability gear and reset discipline.",
