  ],
  "articleBody": "1) Fight design\nKing Hrolf rewards consistency more than burst: punish once, reset, and avoid long commitments.\n\n2) Prep (gear roles)\n- Stability baseline: mitigation/sustain to remove one-shot and snowball risk\n- Runics: two short, landable options\n- Relic: one emergency reset tool\n\n3) Core rules\n- unblockables first\n- one punish then disengage\n- if hit, create space and re-center the camera\n\n4) Learn only 3 punish windows\n- end of big gap-closers\n- after major AoE/projectile specials\n- after long strings\n\n5) Route\n- clear all Berserkers to unlock the fight\n- win with stability first, then add burst pieces later\n\nRelated: use the all-Berserkers index for unlock order and locations.",
